"text\", \"q\": \"SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute) was used to conduct all analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"To estimate annual mortality, an annual proportion with a reported death was calculated using quarterly reported data\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"CMRs were similar and substantially high in these two samples.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}